        "id": 155,
        "name": "Star Wars: Yoda Stories",
        "summary": "Grab your lightsaber and get ready for terrific Star Wars adventuring in Yoda Stories, the newest in a series of easy-to-play Desktop Adventures from LucasArts. Join Luke Skywalker as he trains to become a Jedi with Yoda, then harness the Force and cross the galaxy to meet exotic aliens, collect stange devices and weapons and deal the Galactic Empire one crippling blow after another - all within an hour!",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co74jd.jpg",
        "release_date": 859766400,
        "rating": 62.18889768210063,
