      {
        "id": 1179,
        "name": "Lufia: The Legend Returns",
        "summary": "The island of the Sinistrals, Doom Island, sank deep into the sea after the second Doom Island War. It was believed to be in an eternal sleep, but has once again begun silently beating, preparing to make its appearance in the sky for the third time. The evil Sinistrals have again been resurrected and released an unforseen terror on the land. A force has awaken witin you... a spiritual flow that draws you to a conflict that will save the world! The power of Maxim's legendary bloodline lives in you... The thread of destiny guides you through an adventurous journey looking for an unknown destination!",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co2mkb.jpg",
        "release_date": 999820800,
        "rating": 70.57387814511932,
        "rating_count": 8,
        "genres": "Role-playing (RPG)",
        "platform_ids": "22,37",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/lufia-the-legend-returns",
        "cached_at": 1772527929
      },
      {
        "id": 1424,
        "name": "Conker's Pocket Tales",
        "summary": "It's Conker's birthday and someone crashed his party! The Evil Acorn has stolen all of Conker's presents and kidnapped his best chipmunk friend, Berri. Now you must take on the role of the bushy-tailed hero, pursuing your nemesis throughout 6 visually-stunning worlds to rescue Berri and save your birthday from complete disaster. Strain your brain to solve challenging puzzles, battle the Evil Acorn's horde of minions with your trusty slingshot, and even flex your muscles in sporting events as you track your foe to the final showdown!",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co4smz.jpg",
        "release_date": 928800000,
        "rating": 52.85085557355116,
