        "summary": "Since the dawn of time they have fought each other. Now as a vicious monster threatens their beautiful land, the Pimmons, Amazons and Sajikis must unite to overcome this terrible evil. Only be these three heroes working together can the fire breathing monster be defeated, but they need your help.",
