      {
        "id": 49877,
        "name": "Super Mario Bros. Deluxe",
        "summary": "Bowser has once again taken over the Mushroom Kingdom, and it's up to Mario to put an end to his sinister reign. Battle Bowser's vile henchmen through 32 different levels - all taken directly from the 1985 classic! Then move on to collect special Red Coins and Yoshi Eggs in the Challenge Mode. Or face off against a friend and race through 8 competition courses in the all-new VS Mode! This time there's a lot more to do than just save a Princess, so get ready for a brick-smashin', pipe-warpin', turtle-stompin' good time!",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co2299.jpg",
