      {
        "id": 49923,
        "name": "JumpStart: Dino Adventure Field Trip",
        "summary": "JumpStart: Dino Adventure Field Trip focuses on preschool and kindergarten concepts.\nIn this game, Frankie is sent back to the time of the dinosaurs using the Time Machine. He meets a mother pterosaur, whose eggs have disappeared. Frankie goes on an adventure to help her recover the five lost pterosaur eggs.",
