      {
        "id": 49950,
        "name": "Quest: Fantasy Challenge",
        "summary": "As you're leaving a party at the castle, you're suddenly attacked by a swarm of evil monsters. Now you must fight your way through the monsters to get home. In each of the 20 levels, you must collect gems and open chests that are scattered throughout. However, there are a large number of enemies on your tail including Hellhounds, Apophis, Bumbershoot, Rocky, Skeletons, and Scorpions. Luckily, you have a magic wand that will destroy them, but there's a catch it must recharge between shots. There are also a multitude of power-ups like Fresh Bread, Mint Leaves, Honey Leaves, Dew Drops, Spirit Light, Healing Potion, Heroes Drink and the Dragon's Potion that will help you along the way. Try to collect all of the items and get home safely in QUEST FANTASY CHALLENGE.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/to5phtnnmagnywdp3kfy.jpg",
        "release_date": 925516800,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Adventure",
        "platform_ids": "22",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/quest-fantasy-challenge",
        "cached_at": 1772527929
      },
      {
        "id": 49951,
        "name": "Puzzle Master",
        "summary": "The Goblin King has corrupted the elements and is flooding the world, and it's up to you to save it. Groups of four elements fire, water, stone, and wood fall from the sky. You must position the elements in such a way that three of the same type touch each other, and are thus eliminated. However, there are some complicating factors: monsters will appear on the play field and will throw pollution blocks that cannot be removed. Further, each round has some tasks which range from watering a flowerpot to triggering a drawbridge that will eliminate several rows which need to be completed.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co2vzg.jpg",
        "release_date": 946684800,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Puzzle",
        "platform_ids": "22",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/puzzle-master",
        "cached_at": 1772527929
      },
      {
        "id": 49952,
        "name": "Pro Pool",
        "summary": "Exciting billiards action comes to the Game Boy Color with PRO POOL. Play a match against the computer or a friend, or play the Single-Player Speed Match and try to clear all of the balls off of the table as quickly as possible. In Hustle mode, you take the role of a pool hustler, traveling from bar to bar placing bets on games. Ultimately, you want to win enough money to buy your own bar. In all of these modes, six different games can be played: 8 Ball, 9 Ball, 6 Ball, 3 Ball, straight pool, and speed pool. And the competition will never get stale thanks to the 64 different computer opponents to play. Plus, an outstanding physics engine makes this the most realistic pool game available for the Game Boy Color. Try to become a great hustler with PRO POOL.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co2v9j.jpg",
        "release_date": 971308800,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Sport",
        "platform_ids": "22",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/pro-pool",
        "cached_at": 1772527929
      },
      {
        "id": 49953,
        "name": "Pro Darts",
        "summary": "PRO DARTS brings the greatest of all British pub games to the Game Boy Color. You can play as eight different characters (two have to be unlocked), each with unique ratings in strength, nerve, and accuracy. Once you have selected your character, use the Practice mode to learn the rules of the six different games Cricket, 301, 301 Double Out, Around the World, 501, and 501 Double Out. When you are ready for some competition, you can challenge the computer to a game on three different difficulty settings. If your friends want to get in on some of the action, you can challenge them to a game without having to use a link cable. No matter how you play, you must aim the dart and use a power meter to send it flying. Play PRO DARTS, and get all of the darts action you could ever want.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/oe72yagyeu9joak2tvr5.jpg",
        "release_date": 1015459200,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Sport",
        "platform_ids": "22",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/pro-darts",
        "cached_at": 1772527929
      },
      {
        "id": 49955,
        "name": "NSYNC: Get to the Show",
        "summary": "With such notable worldwide popularity, it was only a matter of time before the boys of NSYNC got their own handheld video game. Join JC, Justin, Chris, Joey, and Lance in the most daring adventure the group has ever embarked upon, helping them get to the show before curtain time. Of course, life is never easy for these highly sought-after recording artists, so you'll have to help them with such challenges as making snacks and running errands in a stretch limousine. If you can accomplish these feats, you might even get to help the band warm up for their big show with a friendly game of hackey-sack! Packed with challenges and dangerous distractions, the game's real appeal is its goofball spirit and dedication to the band itself. Each of the group's members' distinct personality shines through, making this an awesome title for anyone who likes NSYNC. They might not be the most likely of video game heroes, but have you ever seen a more handsome bunch of characters?",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co4zdr.jpg",
        "release_date": 1010793600,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": null,
        "platform_ids": "22",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/nsync-get-to-the-show",
        "cached_at": 1772527929
      },
      {
        "id": 49957,
        "name": "NASCAR Challenge",
        "summary": "The thrill of victory and the agony of smashing into another car comes to the Game Boy Color in NASCAR CHALLENGE. Hop in and take on the best NASCAR has to offer including Jeff Gordon, Dale Jarret, and Rusty Wallace. Try to master Topeka, Sonoma, and Seneca raceways in the Practice mode, and when you're ready for some competition, try to survive six laps on any of the tracks. To prevail in the championship, you will have to try to win the pole position on each track and beat the pack to the finish line. Depending on how well you finish in each race, you are awarded points. The driver with the most points at the end of all three races is declared the champion. Can you handle all of the excitement and action in NASCAR CHALLENGE?",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co7ydj.jpg",
        "release_date": 946684800,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Racing",
        "platform_ids": "22",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/nascar-challenge",
        "cached_at": 1772527929
      },
      {
        "id": 49958,
        "name": "Jim Henson's The Muppets",
        "summary": "Dr. Bunsen Honeydew has developed a new time machine, so he invites all of the Muppets over to see the new invention. However, something goes awry and the Muppets are sent back in time. Fortunately, Kermit and Animal were running late and were not involved in the mishap. Now these two must travel back in time and rescue their friends. You will take control of Kermit and Animal as they travel through six different time periods that contain a total of 24 levels. Help Kermit defeat enemies with paper airplanes, and use his super jump to collect items. Animal will pound enemies into submission with drumsticks and will shake items loose with his stomp. Will the two heroes be able to save the gang? Find out by playing JIM HENSON'S MUPPETS.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/wnejrp1ve948glbfynza.jpg",
        "release_date": 957139200,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Platform",
        "platform_ids": "22",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/jim-hensons-the-muppets",
        "cached_at": 1772527929
      },
      {
        "id": 49959,
        "name": "MTV Sports: Skateboarding Featuring Andy Macdonald",
        "summary": "MTV SPORTS: Skateboarding Featuring Andy Macdonald puts the excitement of performing a 360-kickflip in the palm of your hand. Choose from four different skaters, including Andy Macdonald himself. Get used to the board and the controls with the Free Ride mode and, when you are ready for some action, try to meet the quotas for each of the 18 stages in the game. Some require that you earn a set amount of points, which you do by collecting the MTV icons, which are spread throughout the arena. To collect each one, you must perform a different trick. Other stages have more demanding quotas including navigating an obstacle course, collecting balloons, and crashing through items. Now you can skateboard anywhere with MTV SPORTS: Skateboarding Featuring Andy Macdonald.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co2vzd.jpg",
        "release_date": 970099200,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
