        "summary": "OCP Technologies has developed an organic and mechanical hybrid supercomputer which they've named \"The Mind\". Unknown to the scientists however, The Mind has secretly been infiltrating computer networks around the world. When the project is finally deemed complete, OCP puts The Mind in control of the security systems of Delta City. At the same time, a gang war erupts in the city and several laboratories are broken into and looted. The police recieve a lead on a gang leader named \"Nexx\" who may be involved and assign RoboCop, a cyborg law enforcement officer, to bring him in.",
