        "id": 248766,
        "name": "Power Rangers: Lightspeed Rescue",
        "summary": "Power Rangers Lightspeed Rescue is a video game based on the series of the same name which was released for the Game Boy Color.\n\nThe Game Boy Color version is a side-scrolling platformer. It features all five Rangers as playable characters and uses a password save system.",
