        "id": 282385,
        "name": "Nintama Rantarou: Ninjutsu Gakuen ni Nyuugaku Shiyou no Dan",
        "summary": "Let's practice ninjutsu (mini game) at Ninjutsu Gakuen! The game is divided into a \"training volume\" and a \"competition volume\". In \"Training Volume\", you can choose your favorite character from Rantaro, Kirimaru, and Shinpei to play the game. Each shinobi has its own characteristics, so let's identify and challenge each individuality! In \"Battle Volume\", you can play CPU battles and 2P battles using communication cables. The number of characters that can be used increases with the \"Training Volume\". There are five types of games: \"jumping\", \"gunning\", \"shuriken\", \"foot rowing\", and \"swimming\".",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co7lyi.jpg",
        "release_date": 985305600,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": null,
        "platform_ids": "22",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/nintama-rantarou-ninjutsu-gakuen-ni-nyuugaku-shiyou-no-dan",
        "cached_at": 1772527929
      },
      {
        "id": 282386,
        "name": "Nisemon: Puzzle da Mon!",
        "summary": "The popular 4-panel manga serialized in \"Comic BomBom\" has become a game! The purpose is to rescue the companions trapped in the mysterious energy hall by Warmon. There are 3 characters that the player can take. Select a \"character that can be used as a weapon\" according to the situation, defeat the nasty \"enemy character\" on the stage, and rescue the \"rescue character\". Since the attack method, speed, and behavior change depending on the selected Nisemon, it is a real pleasure to freely use various strategies. You can also collect the characters that appear in the game as a picture book. Since the back information is also posted in the picture book, you can fully enjoy the charm of the Nisemon character.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co7lyj.jpg",
        "release_date": 997401600,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Puzzle",
        "platform_ids": "22",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/nisemon-puzzle-da-mon",
        "cached_at": 1772527929
      },
      {
        "id": 282388,
        "name": "Nobunaga no Yabou Game Boy-ban 2",
        "summary": "The warlords start moving lively! A masterpiece depicting the Sengoku period is powered up! Now is the time to fulfill the great ambitions of Nobunaga Oda, who has been scattered in the midst of his ambitions by making full use of his unique warlords and doing his best in strategy and tactics! \"Nobunaga's Ambition: Sengoku Gunyuden\" is now available on Game Boy! !! The scenario is equipped with two episodes, \"Gunyu Wari\" in 1560 and \"Nobunaga's Ambition\" in 1582. There are more than 400 warlords. Equipped with \"field battle\" and \"siege battle\" modes.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co7lyl.jpg",
        "release_date": 923616000,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Strategy",
        "platform_ids": "22",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/nobunaga-no-yabou-game-boy-ban-2",
        "cached_at": 1772527929
      },
      {
        "id": 282392,
        "name": "Ojarumaru: Mitsunegai Jinja no Ennichi de Ojaru!",
        "summary": "Turn the fun of the festival into a mini game. If you get a high score in a mini game, you will get a Menko card. Collected Enco Cards can be used to play against friends or exchange Menco. The modes are \"Kin-chan's goldfish scooping\", \"Mike's relaxing quoits\", \"Sachiyo Usui's yo-yo fishing\", \"Tommy grandpa's shooting\", \"Ken's octopus grilling\", \"Haunted mansion captain's haunted mansion\", \"Poverty god and twin dog mini\" \"Golf\", \"Cold Sai and Ko-chan's fortune-telling\", and \"Menko card game\" are available. Fortune-telling can be printed out with a pocket printer.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co7lyr.jpg",
        "release_date": 962323200,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": null,
        "platform_ids": "22",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/ojarumaru-mitsunegai-jinja-no-ennichi-de-ojaru",
        "cached_at": 1772527929
      },
      {
        "id": 282393,
        "name": "Ojarumaru: Tsukiyo ga Ike no Takaramono",
        "summary": "A game of the popular NHK educational anime \"Ojarumaru\". There are 3 modes: \"Tabi-dachi niru (single-player mode)\", \"Tokukun-itashimasu (mini-game mode)\", and \"Welcome to me (two-player battle mode)\". Set in Moonlight Town, the game is played in a sugoroku format, collecting items placed in each square, playing against each other in a mini game, and more when one of them finishes at the pond. The one who collects the points of is the winner.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co7lys.jpg",
        "release_date": 963532800,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
