        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/ojarumaru-tsukiyo-ga-ike-no-takaramono",
        "cached_at": 1772527929
      },
      {
        "id": 282394,
        "name": "Pachi-pachi Pachi-Slot: New Pulsar-hen",
        "summary": "Pachislot \"New Pulser\" simulation game. In the \"research mode\" that completely reproduces the actual pachislot \"New Pulser\", you can freely change the speed of reel rotation, set values, whether or not a flag is established, etc., and you can mark any pattern to make it easier to press. It has a \"push marker\" function. In \"Story Mode\" where the story progresses with pachislot, the purpose is to defeat the Pachislot Great Demon King who aims to conquer the pachislot world in a bonus city where people who cannot live without pachislot live.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co7lyt.jpg",
